<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>How we must give Him all our heart and from all idols turn!</l><l>Oh, who else could there be who loves so tenderly?</l><l>Lord Jesus, You’re the only One who makes our heart to burn—</l><l>O please do not delay! Come quickly, e’en today!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>A glorious Bride He is preparing for His wedding day;</l><l>She’ll be so bright and pure, fine linen covering her.</l><l>O Lord, work in Thy righteousness, this is the only way;</l><l>And blessed we will be to join that feast with Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
